  "scope": "Product post-image request correspondence shares cold successor capability, lazy canonical sequence, derived product identity, operation and exact budget checks. The real VM retains full frame admission, canonical token policy, checked current/legacy deserialization, identity allocation and original budget/recovery authority. VM-free parsed two-call capture/reentry uses the same correspondence gate on original and wire-restored frames without changing results, preparations or fuel. Opaque local tokens require no Clone/Debug/serde/Send traits; trusted hooks run at most once, release skipped captures and propagate unwind without retry. Consistency is not source/frame admission, live authority, receipt authenticity or durable recovery. No product version, wire schema, independent durable VM or physical extraction promotion.",
